 | TCSR-555
 | Two-Component Structural Repair
 | TECHNICAL DATA SHEET VER NO. N.1
PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONS
TCSR-555 is a two-component, solvent-free, epoxy system for repairing cracked and damaged concrete structures. It is
used to bond new structural concrete to old concrete, bricks & steel component as it gives excellent bonding properties with
various construction surfaces.
