STORAGE & HANDLING PRECAUTIONS
Product should be stored in a dry place in their original, properly closed containers at temperature between 2-40°C. Partially
emptied container should be closed immediately.
COVERAGE
15-20 sqft./kg per 2 coats @ 300 micron
SHELF LIFE
24 months from the date of manufacturing
